; One variable: a NoiseTexture2D whose `noise` and `color_ramp` are ExtResources to a saved
; FastNoiseLite and a saved Gradient (.tres). unit-noisetexture2d inlines both, and nothing else
; saves either as a file. Losing the file route leaves a texture without noise, so the sprite
; draws nothing over the backdrop.

